 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape report
+
+The landscape report aggregates the analyses found under an analysis root. Two command names create or refresh it, with identical behaviour and options:
+
+* `analyzeLandscape` - the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands, creates or updates the landscape report (`<analysis-root>/_sokrates_landscape/`)
+* `updateLandscape` - the same command under its original name, kept so existing scripts keep working
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for the available options.
+
